This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:37.480
October 1st, 1587 - Kyoto, Kitano Tenman-gū Shrine

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:42.030
Hechikan used to live in Sakamotoya in Kyoto.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.650
He learned the way of the tea from the late Takeno Jōō.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:47.300
His first nickname is "Dreamer."

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:50.050
The character in his name represents the side of a person.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:55.080
So Hechikan means "Unable to reach out to half a man."

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.460
That's enough.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:02.150
Like with Rikyū, I've been floored with his imperfection.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.750
Start From the Beginning Again

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:17.130
A vermilion umbrella with two tatami.

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:20.940
No treasures of any kind. That's it?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:22.910
I'm amazed.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:28.570
He puts on no airs at all.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:33.770
The shade from the umbrella naturally forms a barrier.

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:39.320
The vermilion color provides an adequate glow for nobles.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.530
Master Rikyū.

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.150
As expected from my peer.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:52.070
His outdoor way of the tea surpasses my own.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.230
Delicious.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.900
You did not want me to upset my stomach,

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.010
so you purposely made the tea dilute?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.780
About 20 people, I guess?

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:22.760
That's the maxinum number of guests I can take.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:29.480
As someone who has served over 100 guests, you should understand what I mean.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:37.230
Why don't we finish up here?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:42.040
You can go back home feeling relaxed.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:46.560
Wouldn't it feel nice to feel up the titties of the women beside you?

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.940
Listen up, everyone!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:11.920
Thank you all for making the trip here today!

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.500
The Kitano tea ceremony has come to a close!

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.620
That's great.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.520
If this had gone on for weeks,

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.490
no money in the world would have been enough.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:29.840
And the best aesthete at this tea ceremony,

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:34.120
in other words, the number one tea master in the world, will get a stipend in rice!

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.760
That man is...

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.820
Please wait!

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:58.080
Please do not decide that quickly!

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:07.360
I know Master Hechikan's tea ceremony is amazing.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:15.870
My tea ceremony is ruined, but I believe it was on the same level!

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:22.450
Over 250 people lined up for it!

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:26.560
I, Furuta Oribe, ask for this with ultimate gratitude.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.810
Please give me one more chance!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:47.860
~ Fifty years! A man’s lifetime! Compared to the span of Heaven... ~

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:48.960
All right.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:58.160
~  It is but a very dream. ~

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:03.850
Hechikan and Oribe, we shall hold another tea ceremony later at the Juurakudai.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:07.300
We will decide who the number one tea master is then.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:27.050
~ There is no such thing as death. ~

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.730
Now I'm satisfied, Brother.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:34.680
Thank goodness you did not decide here.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.890
I think Rikyū's skills have not been surpassed.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:45.970
Sasuke granted me an excuse.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:50.780
I did not decide today because I am waiting for Kamiya Sōtan to arrive here.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.590
Hechikan would have been a fine choice,

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.690
but after thinking things through, Sōtan is our best choice.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:03.260
In any case, Rikyū cannot stay in his position any longer.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:10.580
Perhaps we should have Rikyū decide his own successor?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:25.640
Brother once revered Rikyū like a second father. What happened?

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:34.790
On the 12th of the month, I will have a showdown with Master Hechikan.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:39.610
Kamiya Sōtan may also take part if he arrives at the capital on time.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:45.740
The judges will include the Chief Advisor, Master Rikyū,

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:49.380
Hosokawa Yūsai, as well as other masters of tea.

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:57.970
Master Ueda, Master Kagenobu, can you two help me out?

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:02.930
I used up every last bit of inspiration at that tea ceremony.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:07.050
What kind of ceremony do I need to become number one in the world?

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:11.290
I think you should use these doors with the water droplet design.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.560
If all tea ceremonies use these kind of doors,

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:17.900
it'll bring about a certain air of mystery.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:21.130
How is that door "imperfect?"

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.900
Master Rikyū seemed to like these doors,

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.260
but I don't.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.470
What about you, Master Kagenobu?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:36.980
I wanted to see you display your skills, so I came all the way here from Mino.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.700
I didn't want to come empty-handed...

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:52.760
This is pretty good.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:57.240
I wanted to show you the progress of your Ten Works,

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:59.790
but these designs are not final yet.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:04.240
Looking at this makes me feel like lava is bubbling out from deep inside my heart.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.400
How in the world did you make this?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.670
I apologize for bringing such useless things.

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:23.790
I can see it, Master Kagenobu.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:30.700
The peak of imperfection.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.930
October 12th - Kyoto, Jurakudai

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.860
Sōtan, can't you put more heart into this?

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.750
I can make you the master of tea if you wish.

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.910
I will have to refuse!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.960
Someone like me is not fit to be the one...

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:07.400
I am only a merchant.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:12.840
I am deeply indebted just to meet you, Chief Advisor.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:20.100
Hechikan is using the Juraku-an here on the premisees.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:27.050
Lord Furuta is setting up a new tea room further away.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:31.210
Please take part in both of their ceremonies and decide who will be number one.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:38.970
Master Hechikan wants to serve us individually starting with the Chief Advisor.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.090
Where did you go last night, Hidenaga?

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.800
Please hurry up.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:56.760
I already know who's number one without going in.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.960
Kamiya is not interested, so Hechikan wins.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:07.400
Having a warrior or a noble become the head of tea will only bring trouble to me.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.650
Hosokawa Yūsai is not worth bringing up.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:12.820
In any case,

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:16.170
I have to take down Rikyū.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.860
M-Mother!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:34.330
You bastard, Hechikan! What are you plotting!?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.500
You piece of shit!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.510
Sit down!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.050
Listen, Tōkichi.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.320
You cannot relieve Master Rikyū of his position.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:58.000
He is a good man.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:03.850
He kindly taught me the ways of tea.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:11.680
When he was busy, he would even send his wife Oriki over.

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:18.170
He even showed me directy last time.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:21.930
When I heard his soft breath beside my ears,

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:24.380
my heart skipped a beat.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:31.050
I felt like wanting to be embraced by a man again.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:36.610
I've been quite lonely since my two husbands passed.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.890
Where's my answer, Tōkichi?

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.580
Answer me!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.960
You don't want to become number one!?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:53.860
You don't want to become known for your way of the tea!?

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:56.270
You will be rewarded beyond your wildest dreams!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:01.990
I'll become someone rich then.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.740
I won't be able to enjoy my simplistic way of life.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.370
You got me, Hidenaga...

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.090
I take all responsibility.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:32.180
Please do not punish Master Hechikan.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:36.680
I still respect Master Rikyū, like Father did.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.970
That's enough.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:43.100
Have Mother return to Osaka before the other judges enter.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.010
I'm exhausted.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:53.680
Just pick the number one by yourselves.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:57.770
And Rikyū!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.330
I've had enough of imperfection.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:05.900
Japan has beauty in its elegance, too.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.230
Right, Yūsai?

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:11.400
That's correct.

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.800
All of you better do your jobs properly.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.760
Will beating these barrels really bring about an air of antiquity?

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.070
Well...

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:39.990
They're coming.

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:48.650
I've always thought the Chief Advisor's way of the tea was strange.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.760
That idiotic tea ceremony, too.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.450
Displaying the beauty of Japan? What an excuse.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:01.760
There must have been another reason related to the tea ceremony.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.980
When I reliquished the Hosokawa name to my son and became Yūsai,

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:15.550
I became the Chief Advisor's assistant in all things relating to the arts.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:19.050
That man is only interested in new things.

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:23.500
I'm afraid he does not understand the true meaning of imperfection.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:28.870
That is why he is at such odds with your way of the tea.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:32.600
If you insist on imperfection to the bitter end,

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:36.090
please keep my son Tadaoki out of this mess.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.240
No way... This!?

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.090
Welcome!

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.920
I've had enough of this!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:22.000
You two can decide who's number one.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.330
Wow!

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:32.460
Excavating a part of the ground that was the remains of a residence... I've seen this in Kyushu before.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.880
I may not know much about imperfection,

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:39.180
but you've made my heart dance with thoughts of ancient times!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:45.230
Master told me before that black symbolizes the old.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:52.040
It's a bit embarrassing, but I've used that as a theme here.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.160
Please enjoy your time here in ancient times.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.510
This is an interesting idea.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:06.310
Putting aside your last ceremony on top of a pine tree,

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:09.830
you have gone above and beyond to the point of being unnatural.

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.930
I cannot help but smile.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:15.990
But...

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.940
There is one thing I must say.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:26.370
The ancient scholar, Confucious, once said this,

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:31.450
something all masters of tea should keep in mind.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:37.500
"More than enough is too much."

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.110
In other words,

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:48.720
what you are doing now has nothing to do with imperfection.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:54.720
Furuta Oribe, you are not number one. You are just a naive novice.

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:30.060
November, 1587 - Residence of Furuta Oribe

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.800
Western Hills, Kotari Village, Jihei here.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.150
150 liters of rice.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.880
Heiroku from the same village.

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:37.180
135 liters of rice.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.560
We have received their payment.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.930
Good. Our land survey is going smoothly.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:48.870
But Mozume Village's Heizō Shinrokurō has not paid a part of his dues.

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.560
What should we do about him?

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:55.470
Taxation must be fair. Go and demand payment.

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:56.880
I understand.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.140
But do not go overboard.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.070
We can live our lives like this thanks to our citizens.

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:08.880
Have him pay what he can, even if in installments.

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:15.270
He has been quite serious since half a month ago.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.420
I thought he would be depressed after losing out on the number one title.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:23.300
But he knows a lot about aesthetics and official business.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:29.870
Ouch!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.320
That won't do, Shigetsugu.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:36.170
Straighten your shoulders, stick close to your face, then release softly.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:44.110
Understand?

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.030
You idiot!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.290
You won't become an elite warrior if you don't hone your skills!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:56.000
Aren't you obsessed in the way of the tea, Father?

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:59.950
I want to climb to the top of the aesthetes like you!

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:02.660
My dear.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.810
Master Katō Kagenobu is here to see you.

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:12.140
An apprentice from the Muta Furnace made this nice-looking Tenmoku tea bowl.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:19.850
We can finally make bowls close to the ones from China using just feldspar.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.260
This is all for your sake, Lord Oribe.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:27.160
I will be giving these to the Emperor.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.890
What is going on here?

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:48.240
Something this amazing appears in front of me, but my heart remains unmoved.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:53.400
Furuta Oribe, you are not number one. You are just a naive novice.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:59.820
Do I have to give up my pursuit of aesthetics as well?

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:14.040
I thought by working hard in official business I could regain my interest in the elegant.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.300
But that wasn't the case.

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:20.340
Wishing and hoping for nothing is a hardship all by itself.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:25.170
Please don't be so concerned about the tea ceremony.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:30.270
Your status here in Osaka castle is still very high.

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:34.410
This is such a selfish concern of mine.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:38.360
I was able to live on in this world of chaos.

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:40.690
I have a wonderful son.

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.050
I live without worries.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:55.780
But even though I understand all of that...

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:58.410
Even as a man who realizes all of that...

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:03.050
I cannot stop the anxious cold sweat from inside of me.

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:07.780
I want to leave something behind in this world so that I will be remembered.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:13.690
I thought I could pass on my name as a true aesthete...

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:19.250
We humans live for 50 years.

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:24.270
A life full of delusions.

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:48.340
Can you remove the thin layer of laminate between the bedding?

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:56.590
The laminate may bring about an air of elegance,

00:22:56.590 --> 00:22:58.340
but all of that is for naught.

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.460
Everytime I　

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.460
Anata no mune

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:08.850
feel your heart

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:08.850
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:14.940
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:14.940
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:21.120
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:21.120
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:27.280
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:27.280
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:33.370
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:33.370
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:37.250
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:37.250
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:40.830
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:40.830
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:46.700
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:46.700
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:49.700
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:49.700
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:52.310
Without each other.

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:52.310
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:53.270
You should

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:53.270
Soshite

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:58.770
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:58.770
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:02.560
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:02.560
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:08.270
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:08.270
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:14.760
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:14.760
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.820 --> 00:24:20.560
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.820 --> 00:24:20.560
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.040 --> 00:24:26.540
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.040 --> 00:24:26.540
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:35.730
Become swallowed by the flames!

00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:40.950
You brat!

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:49.730
Save me! Rikyū!

00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:52.020
The Cursed Night.

00:24:53.090 --> 00:24:54.310
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.380 --> 00:24:57.940
That is the question.

00:24:56.710 --> 00:24:59.800
The Cursed Night
